{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sim Hospital",
    "steam_appid": 3694050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/14407e2f9ff2cea1ad04c7b8a87a25fa.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=602 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/14407e2f9ff2cea1ad04c7b8a87a25fa.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/90f652ae5c130f18d0268432fa333278.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully running your own hospital is the core objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process, you\u2019ll hire staff (doctors, nurses, receptionists, janitors), treat all kinds of cases (outpatient, inpatient, emergencies), and handle unexpected events (earthquakes, equipment failures, staff fatigue).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By solving problems and expanding your hospital, you\u2019ll enjoy endless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/9cefb8c604979fcbe7f9e6565638a062.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/9cefb8c604979fcbe7f9e6565638a062.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/2cb7e5ddd0072d407ca5005eda3d7803.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build different treatment rooms and hire or train staff with various specialties to handle a wide range of patients:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >psychiatric cases convinced they\u2019re celebrities or game characters, bizarre ailments like enlarged tongues or swollen heads, and even chronic patients requiring long-term hospitalization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/27728a25392dfd13a8d42cba290b0912.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/27728a25392dfd13a8d42cba290b0912.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/a615610eaf914f4ad5d9a60043fde43f.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your hospital any way you like\u2014Japanese, European, vintage\u2014and sprinkle in lavish decorations to create a one-of-a-kind campus. It\u2019s all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/ed7e51c29b45807a24ee849608b928fe.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/ed7e51c29b45807a24ee849608b928fe.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/5006645cf8fe271dc59d640c9bc20698.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/920294844c31b11af4141caeb8110943.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/920294844c31b11af4141caeb8110943.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By researching new technologies you\u2019ll boost treatment efficiency and resource gathering. As the game progresses, these upgrades will continue to enhance your experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/b455937bf7e8932d1bd530d1084c0430.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/b455937bf7e8932d1bd530d1084c0430.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/14407e2f9ff2cea1ad04c7b8a87a25fa.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=602 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/14407e2f9ff2cea1ad04c7b8a87a25fa.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/90f652ae5c130f18d0268432fa333278.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully running your own hospital is the core objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process, you\u2019ll hire staff (doctors, nurses, receptionists, janitors), treat all kinds of cases (outpatient, inpatient, emergencies), and handle unexpected events (earthquakes, equipment failures, staff fatigue).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By solving problems and expanding your hospital, you\u2019ll enjoy endless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/9cefb8c604979fcbe7f9e6565638a062.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/9cefb8c604979fcbe7f9e6565638a062.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/2cb7e5ddd0072d407ca5005eda3d7803.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build different treatment rooms and hire or train staff with various specialties to handle a wide range of patients:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >psychiatric cases convinced they\u2019re celebrities or game characters, bizarre ailments like enlarged tongues or swollen heads, and even chronic patients requiring long-term hospitalization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/27728a25392dfd13a8d42cba290b0912.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/27728a25392dfd13a8d42cba290b0912.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/a615610eaf914f4ad5d9a60043fde43f.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your hospital any way you like\u2014Japanese, European, vintage\u2014and sprinkle in lavish decorations to create a one-of-a-kind campus. It\u2019s all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/ed7e51c29b45807a24ee849608b928fe.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/ed7e51c29b45807a24ee849608b928fe.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/5006645cf8fe271dc59d640c9bc20698.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/920294844c31b11af4141caeb8110943.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/920294844c31b11af4141caeb8110943.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By researching new technologies you\u2019ll boost treatment efficiency and resource gathering. As the game progresses, these upgrades will continue to enhance your experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/b455937bf7e8932d1bd530d1084c0430.poster.avif?t=1749975628\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/b455937bf7e8932d1bd530d1084c0430.webm?t=1749975628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
